msgstr "Créé par"

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_child_protection.field_cms_form_partner_child_protection_charter__create_date
msgid "Created on"
msgstr "Créé le"

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_child_protection.field_cms_form_partner_child_protection_charter__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Nom affiché"

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid "Expected/Acceptable Behaviors"
msgstr "Comportements attendus/acceptables"

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_page
msgid ""
"I am aware that if I violate the Code of Conduct, I\n"
"                                            may be subject to disciplinary "
"measures, up to and\n"
"                                            including termination of "
"employment, volunteer or\n"
"                                            contractor status, Board or "
"council membership,\n"
"                                            sponsorship, or any other "
"associations I have with\n"
"                                            the child and youth development "
"center,\n"
"                                            Compassion International, and/or "
"International\n"
"                                            Partner."
msgstr ""
"Je suis conscient qu’en cas de violation du Code de conduite, je peux être "
"sujet à des mesures disciplinaires,\n"
"jusqu’à la cessation de mon statut d’employé, de bénévole, d’ambassadeur, de "
"membre du conseil, de mon\n"
"parrainage ou de toute autre association existante avec les centres de "
"développement, Compassion Suisse ou un\n"
"partenaire international."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_page
msgid ""
"I have read and fully understand the content of the\n"
"                                            Code of Conduct and agree to ask "
"questions about\n"
"                                            anything I did not understand."
msgstr ""
"Avoir lu et entièrement compris le contenu du Code de conduite et suis "
"conscient qu’il est de ma responsabilité\n"
"de poser des questions en cas d’incompréhension."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I recognize that I am accountable for my response to a\n"
"                    child or youth’s behavior; even when a child or youth\n"
"                    behaves in a physically inappropriate or sexually\n"
"                    suggestive manner."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que je suis responsable de ma réponse face à l’attitude d’un "
"enfant ou d’un jeune; même si l’enfant\n"
"ou le jeune se comporte de manière physiquement inappropriée ou de manière "
"sexuellement suggestive."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_page
msgid ""
"I therefore agree to comply with Child Protection\n"
"                                    Code of Conduct and Safeguarding without "
"exception."
msgstr ""
"J’accepte toutes les conditions mentionnées dans la charte de Protection de "
"l’enfance sans exception."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I understand that I have power and authority in relation to\n"
"                    participants and their caregivers, even if I do not feel "
"like\n"
"                    a powerful person. I will avoid situations where I "
"could\n"
"                    abuse my influence or misuse my power for my personal\n"
"                    advantage."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que j’ai une autorité et une position de pouvoir vis-à-vis des "
"participants et de leur famille même si\n"
"je ne me considère pas comme tel. J’éviterai toute situation dans laquelle "
"je pourrais abuser de mon influence ou\n"
"utiliser celle-ci pour mes propres intérêts."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_page
msgid ""
"I understand that any violation by me may subject\n"
"                                            me to legal action as "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Je suis conscient que toute violation de ma part peut être sujet à des "
"poursuites légales adaptées."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I understand that if I am unable to affirm adherence to any\n"
"                    updated Code of Conduct for Child and Youth Protection\n"
"                    and Safeguarding, I will inform Compassion immediately.\n"
"                    They may require me to cease involvement with\n"
"                    Compassion, Compassion’s International Partners, any\n"
"                    beneficiaries, beneficiaries’ families or Child and "
"Youth\n"
"                    Development Centers."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que si je ne suis pas en mesure de confirmer mon accord avec "
"les futures versions du Code de\n"
"conduite, j’informerai Compassion immédiatement. Cela peut impliquer la "
"cessation de ma collaboration avec\n"
"Compassion Suisse ou un partenaire international, ainsi que de mon "
"implication auprès des participants, de leurs\n"
"familles ou des centres de développement."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I understand the Code of Conduct for Child and Youth\n"
"                    Protection and Safeguarding may be updated in the "
"future\n"
"                    and commit to keeping myself informed of any updates."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que le Code de conduite peut être mis à jour dans le futur et "
"je me tiendrai au courant\n"
"des adaptations."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_page
msgid ""
"I understand the Code of Conduct may be updated\n"
"                                            in the future. I may be asked to "
"review and re-affirm\n"
"                                            my agreement with the Code of "
"Conduct."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que le Code de conduite peut être mis à jour dans le futur et "
"que je pourrai être amené à réévaluer\n"
"et réaffirmer mon accord avec le Code actualisé."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will always uphold the trust and confidence placed in me\n"
"                    as a child and youth advocate to protect children and\n"
"                    youth and serve their best interests. I will conduct "
"myself in\n"
"                    a way that safeguards participants from all forms of "
"abuse,\n"
"                    neglect and exploitation."
msgstr ""
"Je respecterai toujours la confiance qui m’est accordée en tant que "
"défenseur des enfants et des jeunes, afin de\n"
"protéger ces derniers et de servir au mieux leurs intérêts. Je me conduirai "
"de manière à protéger les participants\n"
"contre toute forme d’abus, de négligence et d’exploitation."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will be careful about my appearance, language,\n"
"                    expressions of affection and other actions to ensure "
"that\n"
"                    my behavior demonstrates a respect for participants, "
"their\n"
"                    families, their culture and their rights. I will follow "
"any\n"
"                    recommendations provided to me."
msgstr ""
"Je soignerai mon apparence, mon langage, l’expression de mon affection et "
"mes actions afin de garantir que mon\n"
"comportement témoigne de mon respect pour les enfants, leur famille, leur "
"culture et leurs droits. Je suivrai les\n"
"recommandations fournies."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will demonstrate respect for all children and youth. I will\n"
"                    not engage in behaviors or use language that "
"humiliates,\n"
"                    belittles, degrades or harms a child or youth."
msgstr ""
"Je ferai preuve de respect envers tous les enfants et les jeunes. Je "
"m’engage à avoir un comportement\n"
"et un langage qui n’humilie pas, qui ne rabaisse pas, qui ne dégrade pas et "
"qui ne porte pas atteinte aux enfants et\n"
"aux jeunes."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will engage in program-related activities with participants\n"
"                    only in open or visible places. In the event that an "
"activity\n"
"                    needs to take place in an enclosed space, I will follow "
"the\n"
"                    “two adult rule,” and ensure that at least one other\n"
"                    approved adult is with me."
msgstr ""
"Je ne participerai à des activités avec les enfants que dans des lieux "
"ouverts et visibles, et au cas où une\n"
"activité doive être pratiquée dans un espace clos, je veillerai à ce qu’au "
"moins un représentant de Compassion\n"
"m’accompagne."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will engage with participants in written and digital\n"
"                    communications in a healthy and respectful manner. I "
"will\n"
"                    follow all guidelines about written and digital\n"
"                    communication with participants."
msgstr ""
"Je m’engagerai à correspondre avec les participants de manière saine et "
"respectueuse.\n"
"Je suivrai les directives en lien avec la communication écrite et digitale "
"(par exemple les réseaux sociaux)."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will never engage in any romantic relationship or\n"
"                    sexual/sexually suggestive behavior, including in "
"person\n"
"                    and digital/virtual interactions, with anyone under age "
"18,\n"
"                    even if it is legal according to local law. Stating I "
"did not\n"
"                    know the person’s true age is not a valid excuse."
msgstr ""
"Je ne m’engagerai jamais dans une relation romantique/intime ni dans un "
"comportement sexuel/sexuellement\n"
"suggestif avec quelqu’un de moins de 18 ans, quelle que soit la majorité "
"dans ce pays. Ceci inclut les interactions\n"
"en face à face et digitales/virtuelles. Indiquer ne pas connaître l’âge "
"véritable de la personne n’est pas\n"
"une raison valide."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will never travel alone with a participant except in an\n"
"                    emergency where circumstances require immediate\n"
"                    movement to protect against serious physical injury or\n"
"                    death. If a life-threatening emergency occurs, I will "
"make all\n"
"                    possible efforts to implement child safeguards when\n"
"                    traveling."
msgstr ""
"Je ne voyagerai jamais seul avec un participant sauf dans les cas d’urgence "
"vitale où les circonstances\n"
"nécessitent un déplacement immédiat. Si une menace pour la vie d’un "
"participant apparaît, je ferai tous les efforts\n"
"possibles pour mettre en place des mesures de protection de l’enfant durant "
"le voyage."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will never use any kind of physical discipline or physical\n"
"                    punishment as a method of correction during "
"programmatic\n"
"                    activities. I will always use non-violent discipline "
"methods\n"
"                    to manage participants’ behavior."
msgstr ""
"Je n’aurai jamais recours à aucun type de sanction physique ou de châtiments "
"corporels (par exemple: coups\n"
"de canne, claques, exercices physiques punitifs ou autres types de "
"châtiments corporels) en guise de méthode\n"
"disciplinaire. Je choisirai des méthodes disciplinaires non-violentes envers "
"les participants."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will never use language, including language in the form of\n"
"                    suggestions or advice, that is verbally, emotionally or\n"
"                    spiritually abusive, sexually suggestive, degrading,\n"
"                    humiliating, shaming, coercive or is otherwise "
"culturally\n"
"                    inappropriate with a participant or their family/"
"caregivers."
msgstr ""
"Je n’utiliserai jamais de langage, y compris sous forme de suggestions ou de "
"conseils, qui soit verbalement,\n"
"émotionnellement ou spirituellement abusif, sexuellement abusif, dégradant, "
"humiliant, honteux, coercitif ou\n"
"culturellement inapproprié à l’égard d’un participant ou de sa famille."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will never visit a participant or their caregiver(s) outside\n"
"                    the bounds of acceptable program standards or trips\n"
"                    and visits expectations."
msgstr ""
"Je ne rendrai jamais visite à un participant ou à sa famille en dehors des "
"normes prévues dans le cadre du\n"
"programme ou des visites."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not condone or participate in illegal, unsafe, coercive\n"
"                    or abusive behavior of any child or youth, including\n"
"                    physical or sexual assault, emotional abuse, in-person "
"or\n"
"                    online exploitation, trafficking, harmful traditional "
"practices,\n"
"                    and spiritual or ritualistic abuse."
msgstr ""
"Je ne tolérerai, ni ne participerai à un comportement illégal, dangereux, "
"coercitif ou abusif d’un enfant ou d’un\n"
"jeune. Ceci inclut l’agression physique ou sexuelle, l’abus émotionnel, "
"l’exploitation en ligne ou en présentiel, le\n"
"trafic, les pratiques traditionnelles nuisibles et les abus rituels ou "
"spirituels."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not disclose personal or private information about a\n"
"                    participant, former participant or their family/"
"caregiver to\n"
"                    individuals outside the program except where it is done "
"in\n"
"                    compliance with required child protection reporting or "
"is\n"
"                    mandated by law. I will not publish personal or private\n"
"                    information without the person’s permission. I "
"understand\n"
"                    that the principle of keeping participant information\n"
"                    confidential applies even if I no longer have any "
"affiliation\n"
"                    with the participant, child and youth development "
"center,\n"
"                    Compassion International, and/or International Partner."
msgstr ""
"Je comprends que le principe de confidentialité au sujet des informations "
"des participants s’applique même si\n"
"je ne suis plus affilié au participant, au centre de développement de "
"l’enfant et du jeune, de Compassion Suisse\n"
"ou d’un partenaire international."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not engage participants or their families in an\n"
"                    inappropriate or culturally insensitive way. I "
"understand that\n"
"                    everyone’s comfort with appropriate physical affection "
"is\n"
"                    different. I will act in a manner that supports "
"everyone’s\n"
"                    personal boundaries and will not engage in any kind of\n"
"                    physical contact with others unless they are comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Je ne toucherai aucun participant ou sa famille de manière inappropriée ou "
"culturellement insensible. Je\n"
"comprends que chacun a une sensibilité différente dans l’expression physique "
"de son affection. Mon attitude\n"
"respectera les limites de chacun et je ne m’autoriserai pas à toucher "
"quelqu’un (par exemple en embrassant, en\n"
"étreignant, en soulevant, en tenant la main, etc.) sauf si cette personne "
"est à l’aise."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not hire any child or force/compel a child to engage in\n"
"                    any form of work that is mentally, physically, socially, "
"or\n"
"                    morally dangerous and harmful to children or youth, or "
"that\n"
"                    interferes with their education. If I want to employ a "
"child or\n"
"                    youth, I will make sure the work supports his or her\n"
"                    development. I will follow all local laws regarding "
"child employment."
msgstr ""
"Je n’emploierai aucun enfant ni ne forcerai un enfant à quelque forme de "
"travail que ce soit qui serait\n"
"mentallement, physiquement, socialement ou moralement dangereux pour un "
"enfant ou un jeune;\n"
"ou qui interférerait avec son éducation. Si je souhaite employer un enfant "
"ou un jeune, je m’assurerai que cela\n"
"soutienne son développement. Je suivrai les lois locales concernant l’emploi "
"d’enfants."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not involve myself in a marriage (whether registered\n"
"                    or unregistered marriages) with anyone under the age of\n"
"                    18, regardless of cultural/religious beliefs or legal "
"age of\n"
"                    marriage."
msgstr ""
"Je ne m’engagerai pas dans un mariage (enregistré ou non) avec quelqu’un de "
"moins de 18 ans, indépendamment\n"
"des croyances religieuses/culturelles ou de l’âge légal du mariage dans ce "
"pays."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will not solicit a romantic/dating relationship and will never\n"
"                    engage in sexual/sexually suggestive behavior with any\n"
"                    participant, regardless of age."
msgstr ""
"Je ne solliciterai aucune relation romantique/intime et ne me livrerai "
"jamais à un comportement sexuel/\n"
"sexuellement explicite avec un participant, quel que soit son âge."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will only engage in activities and relationships with\n"
"                    participants that are in line with biblical principles, "
"and\n"
"                    appropriate to their age and developmental abilities."
msgstr ""
"Je participerai uniquement à des activités et communiquerai avec les "
"participants en accord avec les principes\n"
"bibliques et de manière adaptée à leur âge et à leur niveau de maturité."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will seek guidance about what is locally appropriate when\n"
"                    taking photos or videos. I will always follow "
"Compassion\n"
"                    and church dignity standards and will respect the wishes "
"of\n"
"                    people I want to be in the photograph or video."
msgstr ""
"Je me renseignerai sur ce qui est localement approprié lorsque je prends des "
"photos ou des vidéos. Je suivrai\n"
"toujours les normes de Compassion et de l’Église en termes de dignité et je "
"respecterai les souhaits des personnes\n"
"que je veux voir figurer sur la photo ou la vidéo."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will submit to the lawfully permitted background or police\n"
"                    checks as requested prior to any real-time (in-person "
"or\n"
"                    digital) contact with participants or access to their "
"personal\n"
"                    information."
msgstr ""
"Je fournirai mes antécédents légaux (par exemple: extrait de casier "
"judiciaire) comme demandés en amont de tout\n"
"contact avec des participants."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"I will treat all participants with dignity and respect,\n"
"                    regardless of their gender, age, race, religion, social\n"
"                    background, culture, special needs or disability. I "
"will\n"
"                    contribute to creating an environment where children or\n"
"                    youth are respected and encouraged to discuss their\n"
"                    concerns and rights."
msgstr ""
"Je ferai preuve du respect et de la dignité appropriés envers tous les "
"participants, indépendamment de leur genre,\n"
"de leur âge, de leur origine ethnique ou sociale, de leur religion, de leur "
"culture, de leurs besoins particuliers ou\n"
"de leur handicap. Je contribuerai à créer un environnement où les enfants et "
"les jeunes sont respectés et\n"
"encouragés à partager leurs préoccupations et leurs droits."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_child_protection.field_cms_form_partner_child_protection_charter__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_child_protection.child_protection_charter_text
msgid ""
"If I am aware of any actual or potential abuse, neglect or\n"
"                    exploitation of participants, I will follow the process "
"for\n"
"                    raising concerns. If I do not know the process, I will "
"find out\n"
"                    and follow it. I will respect the privacy of everyone "
"involved\n"
"                    and only share incident information with others who will "
"be\n"
"                    investigating the allegations and supporting the "
"appropriate\n"
"                    responses."
msgstr ""
"Si je suis témoin d’un abus avéré ou potentiel, de négligence ou "
"d’exploitation d’un participant, je le signalerai\n"
"au personnel ou aux autorités concernées. Si je ne connais pas le processus, "
"je me renseignerai et le suivrai. Je\n"
"respecterai la confidentialité de toutes les personnes impliquées et je "
"partagerai les informations de l’incident\n"
"uniquement aux personnes qui s’occuperont de l’enquête et prendront les "
"mesures nécessaires."

#. module: website_child_protection
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_child_protection.field_cms_form_partner_child_protection_charter____last_update
msgid "Last Modified on"
msgstr "Dernière Modification le"

